For running accelerator with AHB:

vcs -R accelerator_top_tb.v accelerator_top.v systolic_with_ahb.v tile_add_ahb.v input_skew_buffer.v output_deskew_buffer.v ahb_wrapper.v systolic_4x4_ws.v pe_ws.v fp_mul.v fp_add.v


For running systolic array:

vcs -R ann_systolic_4x4_ws_tb.v systolic_4x4_ws.v pe_ws.v fp_mul.v fp_add.v


For running processing element (MAC unit):

vcs -R pe_ws_tb.v pe_ws.v fp_mul.v fp_add.v


For running IEEE754 addition:

vcs -R fp_add_tb.v fp_add.v


For running IEEE754 multiplication:

vcs -R fp_mul_tb.v fp_mul.v
